{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-member-js","path":"/team/shweta/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"fe9bd963-f0cb-5515-9088-b645adddc896","html":"<p>Shweta is an economist by training and a data professional by trade. She spent two decades in the corporate world, mostly with consulting firms such as Ernst &#x26; Young, Mastercard Advisors and Accenture, using data and AI to identify, develop and deliver business growth across multiple industries and geographies. She shifted to the development world in 2024, and spent the first two years at Haqdarshak, building data and AI solutions to enable every citizen and MSME get access to government welfare and financial services. Now, Shweta leads the strategic roadmap and evolution of CivicDataLab's data, AI, and product platforms.</p>\n<p>She has an MSc in Finance and Economics from London School of Economics (LSE) and an alumnus of the ILSS Leadership Program. When not working, she is an amateur birder and an avid traveller.</p>","frontmatter":{"name":"Shweta Jain Chaudhury","role":"Head of Data & AI Products","description":null,"quote":null,"image":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":0.8,"src":"/static/feb93527cd23d649070ef014cce28143/2f1b1/shweta.jpg","srcSet":"/static/feb93527cd23d649070ef014cce28143/fd013/shweta.jpg 200w,\n/static/feb93527cd23d649070ef014cce28143/25252/shweta.jpg 400w,\n/static/feb93527cd23d649070ef014cce28143/2f1b1/shweta.jpg 800w,\n/static/feb93527cd23d649070ef014cce28143/724c8/shweta.jpg 1000w","sizes":"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"}}},"medium":null,"github":null,"linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shweta-jain-chaudhury-2776114/","twitter":null,"behance":null,"accentcolor":null,"text":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"fe9bd963-f0cb-5515-9088-b645adddc896"}},"staticQueryHashes":["203280391","2269431855","2668793990"]}